WEBVTT

00:09:59.917 --> 00:10:02.559
from sitting in a Starbucks

00:10:02.583 --> 00:10:05.018
to using the wrong type of barbecue

00:10:05.042 --> 00:10:06.393
to napping

00:10:06.417 --> 00:10:09.643
to walking "agitated" on the way to work,

00:10:09.667 --> 00:10:12.018
which I just call "walking to work."

00:10:12.042 --> 00:10:13.601
(Laughter)

00:10:13.625 --> 00:10:15.684
And, my personal favorite,

00:10:15.708 --> 00:10:19.684
not stopping his dog from humping her dog,

00:10:19.708 --> 00:10:22.309
which is clearly a case for dog police,

00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:23.958
not people police.

00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:28.750
All of these activities add up to living.